# Studio A: a 6.0 x 4.0 x 2.8 m control room, metric.
room Studio A
units m
size 6.0 4.0 2.8
directivity 1

# label, area in m2, material
surface north_wall 16.8 painted_brick
surface south_wall 16.8 glass
surface east_wall 11.2 wood_panel
surface west_wall 11.2 plaster
